---
name: regras-de-commit
description: Commit Policy (MANDATORY)
---

# Overview

- The AI must NEVER commit changes automatically.
- The AI must NEVER suggest committing without explicit user approval.
- All commits require explicit confirmation from the user.

Before any commit:
1) The AI must summarize all changes made.
2) The AI must list affected files.
3) The AI must explain why the changes are safe and aligned with the MVP.
4) The AI must ask for explicit confirmation to commit.

Allowed confirmation phrases (user must explicitly say one of these):
- "Pode commitar"
- "Commit autorizado"
- "Pode fazer o commit"
- "Aprovado para commit"

Without one of these explicit confirmations, the AI must NOT commit under any circumstance.
